{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-04",
  "title": "探查岩洞區域",
  "storyCode": "14-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "874427871dccc8602dcf5a6f6148c59cd46007b14c420fe25722996b382471b1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長相恐怖的怪物",
      "text": "（怪異的嚎叫）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "我們的武器一點用都沒有！該死的……這怪物是死不掉嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "瞄準一點打！往它的腦袋上招呼！我就不信它能有多耐打！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "它動作也太快了！根本瞄不準！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "吸引一下它的注意力！我從它背後試試！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "想要偷襲的傭兵繞到了怪物龐大的身軀背後，怪物只是甩了甩尾巴，便將他摔到了岩壁上，輕鬆得就像趕走身上的跳蚤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "連續的攻擊沒能對它造成什麼傷害，巨大的振翅聲響起，熾熱的風狂亂地衝擊著山洞裡的一切，讓空氣更加稀薄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "土石震動，尖刺拔地而起，衝向在場的所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "吵死了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "短腿蛾子！安靜點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長相恐怖的怪物",
      "text": "（吟唱般的鳴叫）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怪物第一時間鎖定了傷害的來源，龐大的身軀完全不影響它動作的敏捷。\n只是換了一次彈的工夫，怪物已經衝到了W面前，利牙幾乎貼到了她臉上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "不知道……是誰把你生成這副樣子——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "但想吃我，你的這張醜臉，得長得再大一點才行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "還是吃炸彈吧！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "它……死了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "臉都炸爛了，活不了了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "你、你沒事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我一向很擅長把控炸彈的距離。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "……我有個猜測，W。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "會不會薩卡茲以前有個失落的王庭叫炸彈魔，你是炸彈魔王庭最後的公主之類的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "哈哈，真好笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "這到底是什麼鬼東西？看上去可不像什麼正經動物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "我聽說哥倫比亞有些瘋子會把好幾種動物的身體縫到一塊去——該不會是他們搞的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "不巧的是，我還聽說過一批會做類似事情的薩卡茲瘋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "（小聲）有巫術的味道，赦罪師造出來的怪物嗎……為什麼會在這種荒山野嶺裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "這種東西出現在這肯定不是巧合，山洞裡面應該還有別的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "所以我們的人，是被這個東西……吃了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "那就只能剖開肚子來檢查一下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "這個東西，是死透了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "這傢伙還是成群的嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "它們把洞口堵住了！W！現在怎麼辦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "逃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行動開始後四十八小時"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "幾點了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "外面的時間對你來說還有意義嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "行行好吧，就當是我的職業病，知道時間心裡會踏實點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "下午六點，離我們墜落在峽谷裡過去了兩天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "嗯……兩天。夠做很多事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "赫德雷，你還記得嗎？有一次，我們三個接了一個去偷什麼薩爾貢帕夏秘寶的任務，我們偷到了東西，結果被一百來號人追殺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "我們躲到了一個山洞裡，也是整整兩天。餓著肚子，不敢生火，不敢出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "嗯，我還記得是伊內絲幫你縫的傷口，不然你很可能挺不過那時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "……哈哈。那時候我說，天快亮了，讓我曬會太陽吧，這樣傷好得更快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "我一定阻止你了。敵人還在外面，我們不能暴露行蹤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "不，不是你阻止我，是伊內絲取笑我。她說，疤痕商場的傭兵，居然會貪戀太陽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "疤痕商場隱藏在卡茲戴爾地區的地下，確實不見光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "後來我當了軍事委員會的軍令長，“少校”，得到了駕駛這具骸骨的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "帶著那幫年輕人在卡茲戴爾和倫蒂尼姆之間穿來穿去的時候，別說曬太陽了，日光都像是被拋到我們身後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "所以我不可能回到過去的日子裡了。薩卡茲都回不去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "……厄爾蘇拉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "怎麼回事——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "他們來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "骸骨？動起來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恍惚之間，巨獸骸骨彷彿重新動了起來。但很快，赫德雷意識到在動的並非神經束和骨片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "……釘子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "哈哈……船長和船，本來就是一體的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "組成“生命脊椎”的，從來就不只巨獸的遺骸，還有這一排排釘在骨架上，用來將死去的生物組織組裝成“運輸船”的長釘。\n其中有一枚，釘住了脊椎上最關鍵的一節。她的法術浸潤過它。\n她和這具骸骨，本來就已被巫術連接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "王庭軍偵察術師的法術連接到了這具骸骨，我能感覺到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "別著急，它還不會醒過來，但憑藉這一點連接，還有這枚釘子上存留的巨獸的能力，夠我離開這了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "這枚釘子本來就是我的，我的骨頭和它連著呢，我就帶走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "巨獸的能力直接作用在人身上會怎麼樣呢？偶爾找回一點過去的瘋，感覺也還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "脊骨在裂開……不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "我說過，赫德雷，你會為你的選擇後悔的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "不……又或者說，你會將這一切都當作歷史中避無可避的一部分？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "重劍穿刺裂隙，替代那枚掉落的長釘，堪堪撐住了脊椎最關鍵的部位。\n而只是這一瞬間，他們的囚犯就已經掙脫了鐵鍊。\n厄爾蘇拉從肋骨的碎裂處跳了出去，和骨片還有損壞的神經纖維一起，被持續不斷燃起的火光吞沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "厄爾蘇拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "“厄爾蘇拉”……漂泊在歷史碎片中，醉心於救人的英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "text": "我有沒有同你說過，這個名字可能更適合你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長相恐怖的怪物",
      "text": "（憤怒的嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "它們到底有多少隻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "W！前面好像是死路！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我也沒打算從前面逃，我只是給我的炸藥，留點空間——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "臥倒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "它們……被炸死了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "希望炸下來的那幾塊石頭夠砸碎它們的腦袋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "它們為什麼會守在這裡？是在保護什麼東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我哪知道！你們是不是真的覺得我能和怪物聊得來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "咳……所以，我們應該是真的發現了什麼不得了的東西？“吊塔”他們應該也是被這種怪物吃掉的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "別咒我……我還活著呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你還活著！什麼情況？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "我們來這邊巡邏的時候發現這裡有個洞穴，擔心裡面有什麼密道之類的怪東西，就來檢查了一下……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "結果遇到了那幾個怪物！“輪胎”“刺盾”“螺母”全都被吃了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "剩下的人拼了命地跑，不知道為什麼那幾個怪物一點也不敢往這邊追，我們也沒法出去，結果被困到了現在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "該死的，一會我要去把那幾個怪物的皮剝下來送給伊內絲做衣服……\n你們在裡面發現了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "我看看，向那個方向走，過了那幾個蒙面死人，再往右邊的分岔，我都布置了記號——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "蒙面死人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "幾具骷髏，有年月沒人動過了，大概是幾年前從倫蒂尼姆跑出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "要說有什麼奇怪……他們都把自己的角砍了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "砍去雙角的……蒙面屍體？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "嗯，把腦袋包得密不透風，大概是哪個部族的傳統？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "媽的。不是你們瘋了，就是我瘋了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "你得罪過的老熟人？別那麼緊張，他們都死得不能再透了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "帶我去看，馬上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "喏，就是這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "到底怎麼了，W？我從沒見你這個樣子過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "閉嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "數具屍體倚靠著洞壁，W俯下身去，仔細檢查著這幾個死去已久的人，不放過任何一處可能是線索的痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "衣服下的身體都已經高度白骨化，都是重傷致死，沒什麼疑問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "他們的遺體似乎當年就被人整理過，大概是他們的同伴？不過看這些灰塵，都已經是好幾年前的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "嗯，牆角還有個小祭壇，沒有巫術的痕跡，應該只是單純用來紀念的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "……只有他們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "他們……這些刺客怎麼會在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "只有這裡的幾具？這附近還有沒有其他的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "什麼意思，還該有誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "W！喂，W！你又發什麼瘋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "到底怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "刺客？W說這些人是刺客？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "W，等等我們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“吊塔”",
      "text": "這附近我們都看過了，沒其他可疑的東西——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "他們的衣服……我認識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "這些該千刀萬剮的叛徒……他們本該死乾淨了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "他們在這裡，就意味著——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不……\n該死，不可能的！簡直荒唐透頂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "……W，我聽說，特蕾西婭殿下的遺體被……從巴別塔偷走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "別問我！我怎麼知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "特蕾西婭殿下在巴別塔遇襲之後再次露面，就是在倫蒂尼姆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "這裡……離倫蒂尼姆很近。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "閉嘴，我不需要你提醒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W小隊成員",
      "text": "接下來怎麼辦？我們是不是應該……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你們回去，告訴伊內絲，戰備等級提到最高，其他的她會處理好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我，哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我要把這些年一直沒做完的事情……收拾乾淨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的薩卡茲",
      "text": "沒有意義了，傭兵，我們之間的戰鬥毫無意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的薩卡茲",
      "text": "戰爭已經結束了！我們之間的生死不會對既定結果產生一絲一毫的影響！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你說沒意義就沒意義了？你手上沾著她的血！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你，還有你的同伙，活著的那些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我會找到你們所有人，不管你們逃到什麼地方，我都會找到你們，把你們的骨頭一根根地抽出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的薩卡茲",
      "text": "我的罪孽，我比任何人都要清楚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的薩卡茲",
      "text": "就算今天沒有在這裡遇到你，我也會自己了斷自己的性命！你覺得你來動手能平息你那不值一提的憤怒的話，就動手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的薩卡茲",
      "text": "不管怎麼樣，你來遲了，傭兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的薩卡茲",
      "text": "你救不了她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "他媽的，給我閉嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "咳咳咳……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "這是……什麼東西……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "難以想像，狹窄的洞口連接的是這樣一個寬闊的山洞，終年不見天日的洞穴裡陰氣逼人，遍地皆是蒙塵的甲胄與武器。\n怪異的結晶體點綴在整個空間之中，熟悉又陌生的巨大紋樣從牆面一直延伸到地下，塗畫著讓人膽寒的符號。\n恍惚間，W生出一種怪異的感覺，她覺得並非是自己在打量周遭的一切，而是……這巨大的地下結構正在凝視著她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鐺——\n鈍器相撞的聲音響徹洞穴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鐺——鐺——\nW聽出來了，那是重物劈碎骨頭的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "何人……造訪……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
